## 7. What Is an Enhanced For Loop?

Syntax:

```java
for(dataType variable : collection) {
    // Statements
}
```

Example:

```java
int[] arr = {10, 20, 30};

for(int num : arr) {
    System.out.println(num);
}
```

Output:

```text
10
20
30
```

In our problem:

```java
for(int num : result) {
    ans[index] = num;
    index++;
}
```

It visits every element in the HashSet.

