## 8. Time and Space Complexity

Let:
- `n` = length of `nums1`
- `m` = length of `nums2`
- `k` = number of unique common elements

| Complexity | Value | Explanation |
|---|---|---|
| Time | O(n + m) average | Insertions and lookups in HashSet |
| Auxiliary Space | O(n + k) | Two HashSets |
| Answer array | O(k) | Stores final intersection |

